{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/npvSBUE6djxxKg1i9GGO_w","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:49.467545+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/npvSBUE6djxxKg1i9GGO_w","html":"<div><section><img alt=\"图片\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/ZOUEbwoEocz8Pesdse7vwrtspkjNhicGA9M8EGooKpz7BrPwv2TgHh9BPjwiaonrGl30Frxm0UO6dWSMOicvQSwibNy5MMicASXAlZQo4vpOG5WA/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=0\"/></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ZOUEbwoEocz5WR0MNqgOMhyL9VJl814SWvmZnMQ4xrOeQvEJOXBKkK5SCeFiciassBcfuXrduCXdfxVBsD3VWMsz1JibLllsameO8Bu4KJUfY0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>夏</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>令</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>营</span></b></p></section></section></section><section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ZOUEbwoEocxLYDbM4AcrJOpiaGM83GibdxoDRJmnbb0ib9kgxia6KeeHyOiaHicEopwb94wCJvcDOWxgiarNcdNXJH9uFOh0Bu1rsSeic81ICOibGQ0Y/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>东南大学统计与数据科学学院将举办</span></span><font><span><span>“全国优秀大学生夏令营”活动。本次夏令营将通过</span></span></font><b><font><span><span>学院介绍、研究中心介绍、师生互动</span></span></font></b><font><span><span>等活动，增进优秀大学生对统计学院的了解，为有志于在统计与数据科学相关领域深造的优秀大学生提供一个深入了解学科前沿、开阔学术视野并充分自我展示的平台。</span></span></font></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ZOUEbwoEocxdMEFgLHfQ4waqJuribvjnsbVTweWXYq3oPIwLFb1ktGJicmINgCia9cyuicQpwKkLOSaia8QKUJqmfWbrYvaUoWB8mOicoH8yyCgrY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ZOUEbwoEoczqeUPJU2af4gf7qeFYuXpgNhRNyG3wIBEzNzF9PcJngyNSZrN5AiaLWloaS2V28UzYB3JGXjtJ8KwwJib2UVKfD6WOaWHX0dKA4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>学院概况</span></b></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ZOUEbwoEocyHPy7mqHqg0umib4MzPGwTLJDSrnAGhxwlGyHsqIeyFkKcyK9polHrnOiaNDoZph4VtDtHlD6hDdsbN4Zhy9aaAoRgXB3rxvibXY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>东南大学统计与数据科学学院</span></span><font><span><span>2024年12月12日正式成立，由国际知名统计学家金加顺教授担任创办院长。学院依托学校</span></span></font><font><span><span>“双一流”</span></span></font><font><span><span>工科底蕴，践行理工交叉的办学思路，搭建</span></span></font><font><span><span>“三系一中心” 组织架构，打造 “统计理论 + 数据技术 + 行业应用” 三位一体育人体系。学科建制完善，设有统计学一级学科博、硕士点及应用统计专硕点，建成本硕博贯通的全链条人才培养体系。</span></span></font></p><p><font><span><span>学院汇聚了一支国际化、高水平、结构合理的师资队伍。学院现有教职工32</span></span></font><font><span><span>人，其中国际数理统计学会会士、美国统计学会会士1人、国家级高层次领军人才2人、国家级高层次青年人才3人、省部级人才1人。团队由国际知名统计学家金加顺教授领衔，带领国家杰青刘志远教授、万人计划青年拔尖人才孔新兵教授等学术骨干，研究方向覆盖数理统计、机器学习、生物统计、金融统计、交通大数据、高维数据、因果推断等前沿领域，科研成果丰硕。</span></span></font></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ZOUEbwoEoczPf9XV7viaOMLqmXyOnjiaB1ibF2e4xkEzYZlRtQ5StNaeqZoVMJQBsb0YTrxFzEPHxvOq6DhoTVSDS0Swgmxuibh1r9QF4RIzdMw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>活动时间</span></b></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ZOUEbwoEocwia2bWDU9iblLcKyyIXDlWIgdMwobo7PpOlc60pibFEGkgRAo9gZx1NubgMIHps3ficRWn1Bz8ZQL5fibAxp4zr9AuHHwibOEx9dOe4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>2026年</span></span><span><span>7月23日</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ZOUEbwoEoczUYzvPYQfiauWcw5gDPPibzvAM8Hmkocg1yxG0fvHicPVDt6weAr9V81b7NrT9fB8vf3QibfibH36rndCHpP5OfreOTR1u1bDdNRX8/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>活动内容</span></b></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ZOUEbwoEocwovhvv20GgTLhicySTic0uNJVXVXqNHiaSkgIjD4G13BoFDN3ianteCfA3wOESn475cP3ugtnibKviaZ4V61O4WkfTEFjkxfP5icCxicQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><font><span><span>院系介绍、研究中心介绍、学术报告分享</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>师生自由交流、参观校园</span></span></font></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ZOUEbwoEocylVjU9Bic8ibU5hKOgnDGK4fDeicyPmdGUFYcq9djKsHLtytAERUMLjiaQ2lpxca29Q0BV5Kepk2XyEhwUT7fsm73xEibBUgXBjqzw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>申请资格</span></b></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ZOUEbwoEocwgwtaChx8sgbBupNhFnDFcXEX4NJkkMpg0JRFHGNFpBib55ibrIRqLm1oFdQUyESRof8Rellp1aibzTKEpJXyibx6ibexEwgicQuK68/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>报名条件（</span></span><font><span><span>5项须同时满足）：</span></span></font></strong></p><p><font><span><span>☑ 统计学、数学、经济学、计算机科学、自动化、软件工程、公共卫生等专业，或者非相关专业但具有良好的数理背景、修读过主要的数学和概率统计专业课程的全国高校2027年应届本科毕业生；</span></span></font></p><p><font><span><span>☑ 对统计学和数据科学有浓厚兴趣，有志于相关领域的科学研究工作；</span></span></font></p><p><font><span><span>☑ 专业课成绩优秀，排名在本专业名列前茅；</span></span></font></p><p><font><span><span>☑ 至少有2位专家愿意推荐并提供推荐信，专家须为所报学科专业领域内的副教授（含）以上或具有相当专业技术职称；</span></span></font></p><p><font><span><span>☑ 英语水平良好，达到国家大学英语六级水平（450分以上），或者具备同等水平，TOEFL、IELTS、GRE/GMAT等成绩。</span></span></font></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ZOUEbwoEocxZFkG0cYuqSHDL1uynSGKLhm2tTsaibZI4lVFqMsOO2F1yvwdFtZq1R53j7RCmTW2kH9gB6wed83tdp9IWkK4k06n5fxmyGNys/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>申请材料</span></b></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ZOUEbwoEocw8UvuQoxIpuKfWEDVNN5XNLWl8d7xL93ibIzfHTOb7ToLJshibcGvBrRBfPYUFYwSTggxAG5QWhg65X7icaoUmkS5aunaG7RXaIY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>申请所需提交材料清单：</span></span></p><p><font><span><span>1、个人简历</span></span></font></p><p><font><span><span>内容须涵盖：学业情况、学业成绩排名情况、科研情况与科研能力、科研成果或获奖情况、其他补充说明事项。</span></span></font><font><span><span> </span></span></font></p><p><font><span><span>2、个人陈述</span></span></font></p><p><font><span><span>内容要求：介绍个人学术兴趣与专业背景、现有学术成果、后续学习及研究规划。</span></span></font></p><p><font><span><span>3、2封专家推荐信</span></span></font></p><p><font><span><span>请从官网下载对应附件模板，按要求完整填写，务必由推荐专家亲笔签名。</span></span></font><font><span><span> </span></span></font></p><p><font><span><span>4、本科前五个学期成绩单+学业成绩排名证明</span></span></font></p><p><font><span><span>材料须加盖院校</span></span></font><font><span><span>/院系教务公章。 </span></span></font></p><p><font><span><span>5、英语水平证明</span></span></font></p><p><font><span><span>提交</span></span></font><font><span><span>1份英语能力佐证材料，可选：四六级成绩单、TOEFL、IELTS、GRE/GMAT等成绩证明。</span></span></font></p><p><font><span><span>6、其他能力佐证材料</span></span></font></p><p><font><span><span>可选材料：已发表论文首页复印件、各类荣誉获奖证书复印件等可体现个人综合能力的材料。</span></span></font></p><p><b><font><span><span>所有提交材料须保证真实有效，一经查实存在弄虚作假，即刻取消入营资格。</span></span></font></b></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>06</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ZOUEbwoEoczqeUPJU2af4gf7qeFYuXpgNhRNyG3wIBEzNzF9PcJngyNSZrN5AiaLWloaS2V28UzYB3JGXjtJ8KwwJib2UVKfD6WOaWHX0dKA4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>申请方式</span></b></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ZOUEbwoEocyHPy7mqHqg0umib4MzPGwTLJDSrnAGhxwlGyHsqIeyFkKcyK9polHrnOiaNDoZph4VtDtHlD6hDdsbN4Zhy9aaAoRgXB3rxvibXY/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><font><span><span>本次报名提交截止时间为</span></span></font><font><span><span>2026年7月17日24:00</span></span></font></b></p><p><font><span><span>点击链接或扫描下方二维码，在线填写申请信息（唯一报名途径），请务必按要求上传电子版材料，详细说明请参见报名表单。</span></span></font><font><span><span>https://v.wjx.cn/vm/mvsf6f1.aspx# </span></span></font></p><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ZOUEbwoEocwdpeuAl0DUxKScKY26VXpVRmk43HDzicicpVXiblSo5miadpf3zKloFxdPIM0PSgibicZfMRDsFmeSo67UCYY114F6DuvV3iaa8S1iapo/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>07</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ZOUEbwoEoczPf9XV7viaOMLqmXyOnjiaB1ibF2e4xkEzYZlRtQ5StNaeqZoVMJQBsb0YTrxFzEPHxvOq6DhoTVSDS0Swgmxuibh1r9QF4RIzdMw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>其他说明</span></b></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ZOUEbwoEocwia2bWDU9iblLcKyyIXDlWIgdMwobo7PpOlc60pibFEGkgRAo9gZx1NubgMIHps3ficRWn1Bz8ZQL5fibAxp4zr9AuHHwibOEx9dOe4/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1.</span></span><font><span><span>夏令营期间，营员交通住宿自理，</span></span></font><font><span><span>学院统一提供午餐餐券。</span></span></font><font><span><span>请各位营员自行购买参加本次活动的个人意外保险，如活动期间营员擅自离营发生安全事故，责任自负。</span></span></font></p><p><b><font><span><span>2.</span></span></font></b><font><span><span>申请者提交申请材料后，</span></span></font><font><span><span>学院</span></span></font><font><span><span>将对申请人提交的材料进行初审，择优确定夏令营营员名单。</span></span></font><b><font><span><span>入选通知及具体安排将通过邮件</span></span></font></b><b><font><span><span>形式</span></span></font></b><b><font><span><span>发送</span></span></font></b><b><font><span><span>给申请者报名时填写的邮箱</span></span></font></b><b><font><span><span>，</span></span></font></b><b><font><span><span>收到通知的同学须在指定日期前，按照邮件中的要求完成参加确认。未接到通知者即视为未入选，不再另行告知。</span></span></font></b></p><p><font><span><span>3</span></span></font><font><span><span>.</span></span></font><span><span> </span></span><font><span><span>联系信息</span></span></font></p><p><font><span><span>咨询电话</span></span></font><font><span><span>：</span></span></font><font><span><span>025-52091557</span></span></font><font><span><span>（</span></span></font><font><span><span>徐老师</span></span></font><font><span><span>）</span></span></font><font><span><br/></span></font></p><p><font><span><span>咨询邮箱</span></span></font><font><span><span>：</span></span></font><font><span><span>lx_xu@seu.edu.cn</span></span></font></p><p><font><span><span>微信公众号：东大统计学院</span></span></font></p><p><font><span><span>东南大学统计与数据科学学院网址：</span></span></font><font><span><span>https://stat.seu.edu.cn/main.htm</span></span></font></p></section></section></section></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/ZOUEbwoEocwFibbwXodVDuqpu5zJRJIx5orwUFK5E3zlwHTLm0kibnicOVpEJNTHUbCbVlu5o0AJK4gQDAeiaWqUCjHMYMianIXBicRhm5kNAFcyw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"3c904c3df27b403b8d3e9d02855b52473139f819c045dbc4e9d152a45e328ae0","textLength":1598,"sourceSha256":"0391f983f9418b3647a2c03801a224c6e75d824d21f6af19c3dde60781e8afec","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-d3c680c56f17c20e2810","title":"2026年东南大学统计与数据科学学院2026年全国优秀大学生夏令营报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:49.467545+00:00"}
